      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Value indicating that the VCN for the subscription group is in Safe Mode.</para>
          <para>A VCN will be put into Safe Mode if any of the gateway connections were unable to establish a connection within a system-determined timeout (while underlying networks were available).</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/net/vcn/VcnManager#VCN_STATUS_CODE_SAFE_MODE" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.net.vcn.VcnManager.VCN_STATUS_CODE_SAFE_MODE</code>.</a></format></para>
